# Comfort Journey Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env.local and add your private keys.
# .env.local is automatically ignored by Git and will NEVER be leaked or published.

# Optional: Google Gemini Free API Key from Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com/)
# If provided, the AI Concierge uses live Gemini 1.5 / 2.0 Flash intelligence.
# If omitted, the website automatically falls back to its built-in Comfort Journey semantic knowledge engine.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
